Package: npnormalize
Title: Normalize Nonprofit Names and Addresses for Record Linkage
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R:
    person("Jesse", "Lecy", email = "jdlecy@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Turns organization names and addresses into matchable keys:
    a cleaned, abbreviation-standardized name key with legal suffixes
    removed, an exact-lookup core name, USPS-standardized street keys with
    the suite parsed out, nested ZIP prefixes, and the legal form, ordinal and
    number features record linkage uses. Counts name, token and address
    frequencies over those keys, and fingerprints the code that makes them so
    that stored keys can refuse to be used with a different normalizer. Moved
    unchanged out of 'npmatch', which uses it for matching, as does 'matchdb',
    which stores its keys.
